OL,5,G0100 Outback Truckers
OL,6,     FDirt road veteran Dennis Dent goes
OL,7,     Fhead-to-head with a lifelong
OL,8,     Fnemesis. Meanwhile, Christian
OL,9,     FReynolds takes on the wild back
OL,10,     Fcountry on a vital mission to
OL,11,     Fbuild a bridge.
OL,12,G0200 Trucking Heavy
OL,13,     FKings Heavy Haulage must move a
OL,14,     F19-metre, 44-ton bridge, made of
OL,15,     Fsteel and glass, six miles from a
OL,16,     Fyard on the outskirts of
OL,17,     FGloucester - right through the
OL,18,     Fcity centre.
